#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.3.rst:133
msgid ""
"The following recipes have been removed. For most of them, it is unlikely"
" that you would have any references to them in your own :term:`Metadata`."
" However, you should check your metadata against this list to be sure:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.3.rst:138
msgid ""
"``libx11-trim``: Replaced by ``libx11``, which has a negligible size "
"difference with modern Xorg."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.3.rst:141
msgid ""
"``xserver-xorg-lite``: Use ``xserver-xorg``, which has a negligible size "
"difference when DRI and GLX modules are not installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.3.rst:144
msgid "``xserver-kdrive``: Effectively unmaintained for many years."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.3.rst:146
msgid "``mesa-xlib``: No longer serves any purpose."
