msgid "``galago``: Replaced by telepathy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.3.rst:150
msgid "``gail``: Functionality was integrated into GTK+ 2.13."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.3.rst:152
msgid "``eggdbus``: No longer needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.3.rst:154
msgid ""
"``gcc-*-intermediate``: The build has been restructured to avoid the need"
" for this step."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.3.rst:157
msgid ""
"``libgsmd``: Unmaintained for many years. Functionality now provided by "
"``ofono`` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.3.rst:160
msgid ""
"*contacts, dates, tasks, eds-tools*: Largely unmaintained PIM application"
" suite. It has been moved to ``meta-gnome`` in ``meta-openembedded``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.3.rst:164
msgid ""
"In addition to the previously listed changes, the ``meta-demoapps`` "
"directory has also been removed because the recipes in it were not being "
"maintained and many had become obsolete or broken. Additionally, these "
"recipes were not parsed in the default configuration. Many of these "
"recipes are already provided in an updated and maintained form within the"
" OpenEmbedded community layers such as ``meta-oe`` and ``meta-gnome``. "
"For the remainder, you can now find them in the ``meta-extras`` "
"repository, which is in the :yocto_git:`Source Repositories <>` at "
":yocto_git:`/meta-extras/`."
msgstr ""

