msgid ""
"For more information on Build History, see the \":ref:`dev-manual/build-"
"quality:maintaining build output quality with \\`\\`buildhistory\\`\\``\""
" section in the Yocto Project Development Tasks Manual."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.5.rst:280
msgid "``udev``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.5.rst:282
msgid "The changes to ``udev`` are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.5.rst:284
msgid ""
"``udev`` no longer brings in ``udev-extraconf`` automatically through "
":term:`RRECOMMENDS`, since this was originally intended to be optional. "
"If you need the extra rules, then add ``udev-extraconf`` to your image."
