#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.5.rst:289
msgid ""
"``udev`` no longer brings in ``pciutils-ids`` or ``usbutils-ids`` through"
" :term:`RRECOMMENDS`. These are not needed by ``udev`` itself and "
"removing them saves around 350KB."
