#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:104
msgid "Console Output Error Redirection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:106
msgid ""
"The BitBake console UI will now output errors to ``stderr`` instead of "
"``stdout``. Consequently, if you are piping or redirecting the output of "
"``bitbake`` to somewhere else, and you wish to retain the errors, you "
"will need to add ``2>&1`` (or something similar) to the end of your "
"``bitbake`` command line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:115
msgid "``task-``\\ taskname Overrides"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:117
msgid ""
"``task-``\\ taskname overrides have been adjusted so that tasks whose "
"names contain underscores have the underscores replaced by hyphens for "
"the override so that they now function properly. For example, the task "
"override for :ref:`ref-tasks-populate_sdk` is ``task-populate-sdk``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:126
msgid "Changes to Variables"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:128
msgid ""
"The following variables have changed. For information on the OpenEmbedded"
" build system variables, see the \":doc:`/ref-manual/variables`\" "
"Chapter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:134
msgid "``TMPDIR``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:136
msgid ""
":term:`TMPDIR` can no longer be on an NFS mount. NFS does not offer full "
"POSIX locking and inode consistency and can cause unexpected issues if "
"used to store :term:`TMPDIR`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:140
msgid ""
"The check for this occurs on startup. If :term:`TMPDIR` is detected on an"
" NFS mount, an error occurs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:146
msgid "``PRINC``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:148
msgid ""
"The ``PRINC`` variable has been deprecated and triggers a warning if "
"detected during a build. For :term:`PR` increments on changes, use the PR"
" service instead. You can find out more about this service in the \":ref"
":`dev-manual/packages:working with a pr service`\" section in the Yocto "
"Project Development Tasks Manual."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:157
msgid "``IMAGE_TYPES``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:159
msgid ""
"The \"sum.jffs2\" option for :term:`IMAGE_TYPES` has been replaced by the"
" \"jffs2.sum\" option, which fits the processing order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:166
msgid "``COPY_LIC_MANIFEST``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.6.rst:168
msgid ""
"The :term:`COPY_LIC_MANIFEST` variable must now be set to \"1\" rather "
