#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.7.rst:213
msgid ""
"The build history feature now writes ``build-id.txt`` instead of ``build-"
"id``. Additionally, ``build-id.txt`` now contains the full build header "
"as printed by BitBake upon starting the build. You should manually remove"
