#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.8.rst:130
msgid ""
"One of the improvements is to attempt to run \"make clean\" during the "
":ref:`ref-tasks-configure` task if a ``Makefile`` exists. Some software "
"packages do not provide a working clean target within their make files. "
"If you have such recipes, you need to set :term:`CLEANBROKEN` to \"1\" "
"within the recipe, for example::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.8.rst:141
msgid "QA Check and Validation Changes"
msgstr ""

