#: ../../migration-guides/migration-1.8.rst:155
msgid ""
":term:`S` now needs to be set to a valid value within a recipe. If "
":term:`S` is not set in the recipe, the directory is not automatically "
"created. If :term:`S` does not point to a directory that exists at the "
"time the :ref:`ref-tasks-unpack` task finishes, a warning will be shown."
