msgid "BitBake datastore improvements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.0.rst:87
msgid ""
"The method by which BitBake's datastore handles overrides has changed. "
"Overrides are now applied dynamically and ``bb.data.update_data()`` is "
"now a no-op. Thus, ``bb.data.update_data()`` is no longer required in "
"order to apply the correct overrides. In practice, this change is "
"unlikely to require any changes to Metadata. However, these minor changes"
" in behavior exist:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.0.rst:94
msgid ""
"All potential overrides are now visible in the variable history as seen "
"when you run the following::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.0.rst:99
msgid ""
"``d.delVar('VARNAME')`` and ``d.setVar('VARNAME', None)`` result in the "
"variable and all of its overrides being cleared out. Before the change, "
"only the non-overridden values were cleared."
