#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.2.rst:234
msgid "Default Linker Hash Style Changed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.2.rst:236
msgid ""
"The default linker hash style for ``gcc-cross`` is now \"sysv\" in order "
"to catch recipes that are building software without using the "
"OpenEmbedded :term:`LDFLAGS`. This change could result in seeing some "
"\"No GNU_HASH in the elf binary\" QA issues when building such recipes. "
"You need to fix these recipes so that they use the expected "
":term:`LDFLAGS`. Depending on how the software is built, the build system"
" used by the software (e.g. a Makefile) might need to be patched. "
"However, sometimes making this fix is as simple as adding the following "
"to the recipe::"
msgstr ""

