#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:158
msgid "BitBake Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.2.rst:281
#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.3.rst:163
msgid "The following changes took place for BitBake:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.2.rst:283
msgid ""
"The \"goggle\" UI and standalone image-writer tool have been removed as "
"they both require GTK+ 2.0 and were not being maintained."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.2.rst:286
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Perforce fetcher now supports :term:`SRCREV` for specifying the "
"source revision to use, be it ``${``\\ :term:`AUTOREV`\\ ``}``, "
"changelist number, p4date, or label, in preference to separate "
":term:`SRC_URI` parameters to specify these. This change is more in-line "
"with how the other fetchers work for source control systems. Recipes that"
" fetch from Perforce will need to be updated to use :term:`SRCREV` in "
"place of specifying the source revision within :term:`SRC_URI`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.2.rst:296
msgid ""
"Some of BitBake's internal code structures for accessing the recipe cache"
" needed to be changed to support the new multi-configuration "
"functionality. These changes will affect external tools that use "
"BitBake's tinfoil module. For information on these changes, see the "
"changes made to the scripts supplied with OpenEmbedded-Core: "
":yocto_git:`1 "
"</poky/commit/?id=189371f8393971d00bca0fceffd67cc07784f6ee>` and "
":yocto_git:`2 "
"</poky/commit/?id=4a5aa7ea4d07c2c90a1654b174873abb018acc67>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.2.rst:305
msgid ""
"The task management code has been rewritten to avoid using ID indirection"
" in order to improve performance. This change is unlikely to cause any "
"problems for most users. However, the setscene verification function as "
"pointed to by ``BB_SETSCENE_VERIFY_FUNCTION`` needed to change signature."
" Consequently, a new variable named ``BB_SETSCENE_VERIFY_FUNCTION2`` has "
"been added allowing multiple versions of BitBake to work with suitably "
"written metadata, which includes OpenEmbedded-Core and Poky. Anyone with "
"custom BitBake task scheduler code might also need to update the code to "
"handle the new structure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.2.rst:319
msgid "Swabber has Been Removed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.2.rst:321
msgid ""
"Swabber, a tool that was intended to detect host contamination in the "
"build process, has been removed, as it has been unmaintained and unused "
"for some time and was never particularly effective. The OpenEmbedded "
"build system has since incorporated a number of mechanisms including "
"enhanced QA checks that mean that there is less of a need for such a "
"tool."
