#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.2.rst:431
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Both ``devtool add`` and ``recipetool create`` now use a fixed "
":term:`SRCREV` by default when fetching from a Git repository. You can "
"override this in either case to use ``${``\\ :term:`AUTOREV`\\ ``}`` "
"instead by using the ``-a`` or ``--autorev`` command-line option"
msgstr ""

