#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.5.rst:293
msgid ""
"Layers are expected to set ``LAYERSERIES_COMPAT_layername`` to match the "
"version(s) of OpenEmbedded-Core they are compatible with. This is "
"specified as codenames using spaces to separate multiple values (e.g. "
"\"rocko sumo\"). If a layer does not set "
"``LAYERSERIES_COMPAT_layername``, a warning will is shown. If a layer "
"sets a value that does not include the current version (\"sumo\" for the "
"2.5 release), then an error will be produced."
