msgid ""
"``run-postinsts`` no longer uses ``/etc/*-postinsts`` for ``dpkg/opkg`` "
"in favor of built-in postinst support. RPM behavior remains unchanged."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.6.rst:413
msgid ""
"The ``NOISO`` and ``NOHDD`` variables are no longer used. You now control"
" building ``*.iso`` and ``*.hddimg`` image types directly by using the "
":term:`IMAGE_FSTYPES` variable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.6.rst:417
msgid "The ``scripts/contrib/mkefidisk.sh`` has been removed in favor of Wic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.6.rst:420
msgid ""
"``kernel-modules`` has been removed from :term:`RRECOMMENDS` for "
"``qemumips`` and ``qemumips64`` machines. Removal also impacts the "
"``x86-base.inc`` file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.6.rst:427
msgid ""
"``genericx86`` and ``genericx86-64`` retain ``kernel-modules`` as part of"
" the :term:`RRECOMMENDS` variable setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.6.rst:430
msgid ""
"The ``LGPLv2_WHITELIST_GPL-3.0`` variable has been removed. If you are "
"setting this variable in your configuration, set or append it to the "
"``WHITELIST_GPL-3.0`` variable instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.6.rst:434
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``${ASNEEDED}`` is now included in the :term:`TARGET_LDFLAGS` variable "
"directly. The remaining definitions from ``meta/conf/distro/include/as-"
"needed.inc`` have been moved to corresponding recipes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.6.rst:439
msgid ""
"Support for DSA host keys has been dropped from the OpenSSH recipes. If "
"you are still using DSA keys, you must switch over to a more secure "
"algorithm as recommended by OpenSSH upstream."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.6.rst:443
msgid ""
"The ``dhcp`` recipe now uses the ``dhcpd6.conf`` configuration file in "
"``dhcpd6.service`` for IPv6 DHCP rather than re-using ``dhcpd.conf``, "
"which is now reserved for IPv4."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:4
msgid "Release 2.7 (warrior)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:6
msgid ""
"This section provides migration information for moving to the Yocto "
"Project 2.7 Release (codename \"warrior\") from the prior release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:14
msgid "The following changes have been made to BitBake:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:16
msgid ""
"BitBake now checks anonymous Python functions and pure Python functions "
"(e.g. ``def funcname:``) in the metadata for tab indentation. If found, "
"BitBake produces a warning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:20
msgid ""
"BitBake now checks :term:`BBFILE_COLLECTIONS` for duplicate entries and "
"triggers an error if any are found."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:27
msgid "Eclipse Support Removed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:29
msgid ""
"Support for the Eclipse IDE has been removed. Support continues for those"
" releases prior to 2.7 that did include support. The 2.7 release does not"
" include the Eclipse Yocto plugin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:36
msgid "``qemu-native`` Splits the System and User-Mode Parts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:38
msgid ""
"The system and user-mode parts of ``qemu-native`` are now split. ``qemu-"
"native`` provides the user-mode components and ``qemu-system-native`` "
"provides the system components. If you have recipes that depend on QEMU's"
" system emulation functionality at build time, they should now depend "
"upon ``qemu-system-native`` instead of ``qemu-native``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:48
msgid "The ``upstream-tracking.inc`` File Has Been Removed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:50
msgid ""
"The previously deprecated ``upstream-tracking.inc`` file is now removed. "
"Any ``UPSTREAM_TRACKING*`` variables are now set in the corresponding "
"recipes instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:54
msgid ""
"Remove any references you have to the ``upstream-tracking.inc`` file in "
"your configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:60
msgid "The ``DISTRO_FEATURES_LIBC`` Variable Has Been Removed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:62
msgid ""
"The ``DISTRO_FEATURES_LIBC`` variable is no longer used. The ability to "
"configure glibc using kconfig has been removed for quite some time making"
" the ``libc-*`` features set no longer effective."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:66
msgid ""
"Remove any references you have to ``DISTRO_FEATURES_LIBC`` in your own "
"layers."
msgstr ""

