#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:149
msgid "*distutils-tools*: This class was never used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:150
msgid "*bugzilla.bbclass*: Became obsolete."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:151
msgid ""
"*distrodata*: This functionally has been replaced by a more modern "
"tinfoil-based implementation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:160
msgid ""
"The ``distro`` subdirectory of the Poky repository has been removed from "
"the top-level ``scripts`` directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-2.7.rst:163
msgid ""
"Perl now builds for the target using `perl-cross <https://arsv.github.io"
"/perl-cross/>`_ for better maintainability and improved build "
"performance. This change should not present any problems unless you have "
"heavily customized your Perl recipe."
