msgid ""
"This section provides migration information for moving to the Yocto "
"Project 3.0 Release (codename \"zeus\") from the prior release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:12
msgid "Init System Selection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:14
msgid ""
"Changing the init system manager previously required setting a number of "
"different variables. You can now change the manager by setting the "
"``INIT_MANAGER`` variable and the corresponding include files (i.e. "
"``conf/distro/include/init-manager-*.conf``). Include files are provided "
"for four values: \"none\", \"sysvinit\", \"systemd\", and \"mdev-"
"busybox\". The default value, \"none\", for ``INIT_MANAGER`` should allow"
" your current settings to continue working. However, it is advisable to "
"explicitly set ``INIT_MANAGER``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:26
msgid "LSB Support Removed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:28
msgid ""
"Linux Standard Base (LSB) as a standard is not current, and is not well "
"suited for embedded applications. Support can be continued in a separate "
"layer if needed. However, presently LSB support has been removed from the"
" core."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:33
msgid ""
"As a result of this change, the ``poky-lsb`` derivative distribution "
"configuration that was also used for testing alternative configurations "
"has been replaced with a ``poky-altcfg`` distribution that has LSB parts "
"removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:43
msgid "The following recipes have been removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:45
msgid "``core-image-lsb-dev``: Part of removed LSB support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:47
msgid "``core-image-lsb``: Part of removed LSB support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:49
msgid "``core-image-lsb-sdk``: Part of removed LSB support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:51
msgid ""
"``cve-check-tool``: Functionally replaced by the ``cve-update-db`` recipe"
" and ``cve-check`` class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:54
msgid ""
"``eglinfo``: No longer maintained. ``eglinfo`` from ``mesa-demos`` is an "
"adequate and maintained alternative."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:57
msgid "``gcc-8.3``: Version 8.3 removed. Replaced by 9.2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.0.rst:59
msgid ""
"``gnome-themes-standard``: Only needed by gtk+ 2.x, which has been "
