#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.1.rst:230
msgid ""
"``harfbuzz`` now splits the new ``libharfbuzz-subset.so`` library into "
"its own package to reduce the main package size in cases where "
"``libharfbuzz-subset.so`` is not needed."
