"dependencies and multilib, a change was made that now requires the "
":term:`MLPREFIX` value to be explicitly prepended to package names being "
"added as dependencies (e.g. in :term:`RDEPENDS` and :term:`RRECOMMENDS` "
"values) where the dependency is conditionally added."
