"dependencies in your custom recipes, and you intend for those recipes to "
"work with multilib, then you will need to ensure that ``${MLPREFIX}`` is "
"prefixed on the package names in the dependencies, for example (from the "
"``glibc`` recipe)::"
msgstr ""

