msgid ""
"packagegroup-core-device-devel no longer included in images built for "
"qemu* machines"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.2.rst:116
msgid ""
"``packagegroup-core-device-devel`` was previously added automatically to "
"images built for ``qemu*`` machines, however the purpose of the group and"
" what it should contain is no longer clear, and in general, adding "
"userspace development items to images is best done at the image/class "
