"You will now need at least Python 3.6 installed on your build host. Most "
"recent distributions provide this, but should you be building on a "
"distribution that does not have it, you can use the :term:`buildtools` "
"tarball (easily installable using ``scripts/install-buildtools``) --- see"
" :ref:`ref-manual/system-requirements:required git, tar, python, make and"
" gcc versions` for details."
