#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.3.rst:66
msgid ""
"A new :ref:`ref-classes-python3targetconfig` class has been created for "
"situations where you would previously have inherited the :ref:`ref-"
"classes-python3native` class but need access to target configuration data"
" (such as correct installation directories). Recipes where this situation"
" applies should be changed to inherit :ref:`ref-classes-"
"python3targetconfig` instead of :ref:`ref-classes-python3native`. This "
"also adds a dependency on target ``python3``, so it should only be used "
"where appropriate in order to avoid unnecessarily lengthening builds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-3.3.rst:76
msgid ""
"Some example recipes where this change has been made: ``gpgme``, "
"``libcap-ng``, ``python3-pycairo``."
