msgid ""
"Because of the uncertainty in future default branch names in git "
"repositories, it is now required to add a branch name to all URLs "
"described by ``git://`` and ``gitsm://`` :term:`SRC_URI` entries. For "
"example::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/migration-4.0.rst:81
msgid ""
"A :oe_git:`convert-srcuri </openembedded-core/tree/scripts/contrib"
"/convert-srcuri.py>` script to convert your recipes is available in :term"
":`OpenEmbedded-Core (OE-Core)` and in :term:`Poky`."
