#: ../../migration-guides/migration-4.0.rst:85
msgid ""
"Because of `GitHub dropping support for the git: protocol "
"<https://github.blog/2021-09-01-improving-git-protocol-security-"
"github/>`__, recipes now need to use ``;protocol=https`` at the end of "
"GitHub URLs. The same ``convert-srcuri`` script mentioned above can be "
