#: ../../migration-guides/migration-4.0.rst:98
msgid ""
"This is allowed by default from :ref:`ref-tasks-fetch` but not from any "
"of our other standard tasks. Recipes shouldn't be accessing the network "
"outside of :ref:`ref-tasks-fetch` as it usually undermines fetcher source"
" mirroring, image and licence manifests, software auditing and supply "
"chain security."
