#: ../../migration-guides/migration-5.0.rst:189
msgid ""
"The ``cve-check`` class no longer produces a warning for remote patches "
"--- it only logs a note and does not try to fetch the patch in order to "
"scan it for issues or CVE numbers. However, CVE number references in "
"remote patch file names will now be picked up."
