msgid ""
"It is also recommended to update any WKS file to convert dashes to "
"underscores. For example, the ``bootimg-partition.py`` plugin was renamed"
" to ``bootimg_partition.py``. This means that any WKS file using this "
"plugin must change each ``--source bootimg-partition`` to ``--source "
"bootimg_partition``."
