#: ../../migration-guides/migration-5.3.rst:138
msgid ""
"However, the current WIC code automatically converts dashes to underscore"
" for any ``--source`` call, so existing WKS files will not break if they "
"use upstream plugins from :term:`OpenEmbedded-Core (OE-Core)`."
msgstr ""

