"over :oe_git:`resulttool </openembedded-core/tree/scripts/resulttool>`. "
"Here is an example command, which allowed to spot and fix a regression in"
" the ``quilt`` ptest::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/release-notes-4.2.rst:178
