"See this `blog post about regression detection <https://bootlin.com/blog"
"/continuous-integration-in-yocto-improving-the-regressions-"
"detection/>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/release-notes-4.2.rst:181
msgid ""
"This release adds support for parallel ptest execution with a ptest per "
"image. This takes ptest execution time from 3.5 hours to around 45 "
"minutes on the autobuilder."
msgstr ""

