#: ../../migration-guides/release-notes-5.0.15.rst:6
#: ../../migration-guides/release-notes-5.3.1.rst:4
msgid ""
"Users of Alma 9, Rocky 9 and Centos Stream 9 rolling releases have seen "
"obtuse failures in the execution of tar in various tasks after recent "
"host distro updates. These newer versions of tar contain a CVE fix which "
"uses a new glibc call/syscall (openat2). The fix is to update to a newer "
"pseudo version which handles this syscall. This is not included in this "
"stable release but we aim to include it in the next one."
msgstr ""

