#: ../../migration-guides/release-notes-5.3.rst:26
msgid "The minimum RAM requirement is now 32Gbytes (previously 8Gbytes)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/release-notes-5.3.rst:28
msgid ""
"These changes are mainly due to recent additions of the LLVM and other "
"resource heavy recipes. For guidance on how to limit the resources used "
"by the :term:`OpenEmbedded Build System`, see the :doc:`/dev-manual"
"/limiting-resources` guide."
