#: ../../migration-guides/release-notes-5.3.rst:102
msgid ""
"The ``tag-`` parameter in URLs can now be specified alongside the "
"``rev=`` parameter and :term:`SRCREV` variable, and will ensure that the "
"specified tag matches the specified revision."
