msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/release-notes-5.3.rst:171
msgid ""
"Add a fragment for the `CDN` :ref:`sstate-cache <overview-"
"manual/concepts:shared state cache>` mirror."
msgstr ""

#: ../../migration-guides/release-notes-5.3.rst:174
msgid ""
"Add a ``show-fragments`` sub-command to the :oe_git:`bitbake-config-build"
" </bitbake/tree/bin/bitbake-config-build>` utility, to show the content "
"of fragments from command-line."
msgstr ""

